  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/CagadaManso.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 359px\" /></p>\n<p>M&aacute;s de dos horas despu&eacute;s de que el manso de la ganader&iacute;a de Miguel Parejo saliera al aparcamiento exterior del Recinto Multiusos de Onda, a las 14.10 horas, ha hecho la cagada en la parcela 268. El premio organizado por la Pascua Taurina es de 500 euros y las participaciondes se hab&iacute;an vendido a 5 euros.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4295.jpg\" alt=\"img_4295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4296.jpg\" alt=\"img_4296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4297.jpg\" alt=\"img_4297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4298.jpg\" alt=\"img_4298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4299.jpg\" alt=\"img_4299\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4300.jpg\" alt=\"img_4300\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4301.jpg\" alt=\"img_4301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4302.jpg\" alt=\"img_4302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4303.jpg\" alt=\"img_4303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cagadamanso/img_4304.jp